      "text": "[7:20AM] #LagBadagryExpWay\n#Ojo\n#TrafficUpdate\n\nVehicular movement from Abule Ado to Iyana Iba through under bridge ,Volks and Afolabi Ege  is good.\n\nGood movement from Iyana Iba intersection enroute Igando through First gate, Iyana school to Obadore bridge is good to go.\n\n The return journey to Iyana Iba is also okay.\n\nIn and out of Igbo Elerin is better and Afolabi Ege Flyover link to LASU-Isheri road is also good . \n\nAppreciable movement along Badagry expressway from Iyana Iba inward Agbara through Iyana Isashi ,Iyana Era to Custom check point .  \n#FollowLASTMA",
